# FRONT QA — gates

**Артефакт:** с эпиком `memory-bank/front/qa/<epic_id>/qa-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.yaml`; без — `memory-bank/front/qa/qa-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.yaml`. @.cursor/rules/shared/epic-scoped-paths.mdc · `.cursor/templates/qa/epic-step.yaml`

## Gates

1. Lean load §7: `load_now` + qa/bugfix; **не** полный `plan-*.md`
2. Suite: lint · types · unit/component · UX/a11y · **Playwright** — **parent only**
2a. Brownfield replace: leftover check (sunset A/B/C) — PASS при leftover = FAIL. Канон: @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-legacy-fallback-cleanup.mdc §5
2b. **Behavior smoke** при agent/hook/gate FR в plan — suite alone недостаточен. @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc §6
3. Scenario P0/P1; дыры → дописать Playwright до PASS
4. Exploratory browser если live app; иначе `skip: no live app`
5. **fail|blocked:** `review.md` (§Fix plan, §Epic QA) + Handoff — `finish-doc-router.md`

## Abort

- PASS без scenario на user-visible AC · subagent runs tests → reject/FAIL
- PASS при leftover legacy/fallback из plan sunset → FAIL
- PASS при agent/hook/gate FR без behavior smoke → FAIL
